  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u5325df3b\" id=\"u5325df3b\"><code data-lake-id=\"u3f76ffb8\" id=\"u3f76ffb8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3bde5275\" id=\"u3bde5275\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">struct.unpack</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0def4c2f\" id=\"u0def4c2f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\"> 是 Python 中用于将二进制数据解析为 Python 数据类型的函数。它通常用于处理二进制文件、网络协议数据或硬件设备的原始数据。</span><code data-lake-id=\"uf67aa88a\" id=\"uf67aa88a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4a5d1a10\" id=\"u4a5d1a10\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">struct.unpack</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua9e3a966\" id=\"ua9e3a966\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\"> 是 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u684cb32e\" id=\"u684cb32e\"><span data-lake-id=\"uac9fe510\" id=\"uac9fe510\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">struct.pack</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uca4de38b\" id=\"uca4de38b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\"> 的逆操作，后者用于将 Python 数据类型打包为二进制数据。</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22AQn6u%22%7D\"></card><h4 data-lake-id=\"UP3HI\" id=\"UP3HI\"><code data-lake-id=\"u094edfcf\" id=\"u094edfcf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5825fb09\" id=\"u5825fb09\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">struct.unpack</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uecd34ff0\" id=\"uecd34ff0\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\"> 的基本用法</span></h4><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22struct.unpack(fmt%2C%20buffer)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cJpLS%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u7be4bdda\"><li fid=\"u96bafef5\" data-lake-id=\"ufe1e2075\" id=\"ufe1e2075\"><code data-lake-id=\"u54ca746f\" id=\"u54ca746f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud7b611b8\" id=\"ud7b611b8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">fmt</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1c1f6ed2\" id=\"u1c1f6ed2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：格式化字符串，指定如何解析二进制数据。</span></li><li fid=\"u96bafef5\" data-lake-id=\"u7acf4167\" id=\"u7acf4167\"><code data-lake-id=\"ueea07db7\" id=\"ueea07db7\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u90d6b9e3\" id=\"u90d6b9e3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">buffer</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"u09299853\" id=\"u09299853\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：包含二进制数据的字节对象（如</span><span data-lake-id=\"ufd6c6d71\" id=\"ufd6c6d71\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u49a769fa\" id=\"u49a769fa\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub3436905\" id=\"ub3436905\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">bytes</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4b258871\" id=\"u4b258871\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"uaa9c43a1\" id=\"uaa9c43a1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">或</span><span data-lake-id=\"u46848044\" id=\"u46848044\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u8e595f7a\" id=\"u8e595f7a\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf7ea0095\" id=\"uf7ea0095\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">bytearray</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf5929b9c\" id=\"uf5929b9c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">）。</span></li><li fid=\"u96bafef5\" data-lake-id=\"u8bbb21c3\" id=\"u8bbb21c3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2b111ad7\" id=\"u2b111ad7\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">返回值: </span><span data-lake-id=\"u49418edd\" id=\"u49418edd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">返回一个元组，包含解析后的数据。</span></li></ul><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22uRsdl%22%7D\"></card><h5 data-lake-id=\"ZJP1V\" id=\"ZJP1V\"><span data-lake-id=\"u20ebb257\" id=\"u20ebb257\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">格式化字符串 (</span><code data-lake-id=\"ub0fc7c6d\" id=\"ub0fc7c6d\"><span data-lake-id=\"uef0e7f50\" id=\"uef0e7f50\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">fmt</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1757c9cd\" id=\"u1757c9cd\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">)</span></h5><p data-lake-id=\"u81b3805a\" id=\"u81b3805a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0890004b\" id=\"u0890004b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">格式化字符串由以下部分组成：</span></p><ol list=\"u4b45c2b5\"><li fid=\"ue3056ad7\" data-lake-id=\"ud5b698a8\" id=\"ud5b698a8\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf59f7543\" id=\"uf59f7543\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">字节顺序</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7e82c3ab\" id=\"u7e82c3ab\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">（可选）：</span></li></ol><ul list=\"u354d8750\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u14746ee1\" data-lake-id=\"ubbabccda\" id=\"ubbabccda\"><code data-lake-id=\"ude3b110c\" id=\"ude3b110c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u43c29b84\" id=\"u43c29b84\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">@</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u56ed19fb\" id=\"u56ed19fb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：本地字节顺序（默认）。</span></li><li fid=\"u14746ee1\" data-lake-id=\"u5d5ec783\" id=\"u5d5ec783\"><code data-lake-id=\"u6370656d\" id=\"u6370656d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u651f62e2\" id=\"u651f62e2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">=</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6a7c8e26\" id=\"u6a7c8e26\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：本地字节顺序，忽略对齐。</span></li><li fid=\"u14746ee1\" data-lake-id=\"u27498138\" id=\"u27498138\"><code data-lake-id=\"u1ca8370b\" id=\"u1ca8370b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7441b073\" id=\"u7441b073\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">&lt;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u160f70e4\" id=\"u160f70e4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：小端序（低位字节在前）。</span></li><li fid=\"u14746ee1\" data-lake-id=\"uc4b14d9e\" id=\"uc4b14d9e\"><code data-lake-id=\"uc00148fa\" id=\"uc00148fa\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueb7c010d\" id=\"ueb7c010d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">&gt;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3acbcc97\" id=\"u3acbcc97\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：大端序（高位字节在前）。</span></li><li fid=\"u14746ee1\" data-lake-id=\"uf93b449f\" id=\"uf93b449f\"><code data-lake-id=\"ufa8f2bcd\" id=\"ufa8f2bcd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u206482c6\" id=\"u206482c6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">!</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue55310cd\" id=\"ue55310cd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：网络字节顺序（大端序）。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u4b45c2b5\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"ue3056ad7\" data-lake-id=\"u50d4f4ba\" id=\"u50d4f4ba\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u54d505ac\" id=\"u54d505ac\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">数据类型</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u866f066d\" id=\"u866f066d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：</span></li></ol><ul list=\"uf910311b\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u9a96121d\" data-lake-id=\"u2e9bdf9d\" id=\"u2e9bdf9d\"><code data-lake-id=\"ub36c8663\" id=\"ub36c8663\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub51eb453\" id=\"ub51eb453\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">c</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9ed855df\" id=\"u9ed855df\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：字符（1 字节）。</span></li><li fid=\"u9a96121d\" data-lake-id=\"ueb5bd93b\" id=\"ueb5bd93b\"><code data-lake-id=\"ubd9aeb8c\" id=\"ubd9aeb8c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u76a7aecf\" id=\"u76a7aecf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">b</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubbbd332a\" id=\"ubbbd332a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：有符号字节（1 字节）。</span></li><li fid=\"u9a96121d\" data-lake-id=\"u9d5542ca\" id=\"u9d5542ca\"><code data-lake-id=\"uc50de1cd\" id=\"uc50de1cd\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua61b487c\" id=\"ua61b487c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">B</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6ff978ba\" id=\"u6ff978ba\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：无符号字节（1 字节）。</span></li><li fid=\"u9a96121d\" data-lake-id=\"uc140eb69\" id=\"uc140eb69\"><code data-lake-id=\"u325a6af4\" id=\"u325a6af4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0bc61398\" id=\"u0bc61398\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">?</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2739fc5f\" id=\"u2739fc5f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：布尔值（1 字节）。</span></li><li fid=\"u9a96121d\" data-lake-id=\"u56af129a\" id=\"u56af129a\"><code data-lake-id=\"ue6c77b3d\" id=\"ue6c77b3d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubdc7e268\" id=\"ubdc7e268\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">h</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u56c88096\" id=\"u56c88096\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：有符号短整型（2 字节）。</span></li><li fid=\"u9a96121d\" data-lake-id=\"uab9bd559\" id=\"uab9bd559\"><code data-lake-id=\"uc66a3ad8\" id=\"uc66a3ad8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7c48c94f\" id=\"u7c48c94f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">H</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua7fbfa56\" id=\"ua7fbfa56\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：无符号短整型（2 字节）。</span></li><li fid=\"u9a96121d\" data-lake-id=\"uebdd4e1f\" id=\"uebdd4e1f\"><code data-lake-id=\"uf00c5c6c\" id=\"uf00c5c6c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u48bd4cd7\" id=\"u48bd4cd7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">i</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud7e550cb\" id=\"ud7e550cb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：有符号整型（4 字节）。</span></li><li fid=\"u9a96121d\" data-lake-id=\"u34fe93ee\" id=\"u34fe93ee\"><code data-lake-id=\"u90f2eda4\" id=\"u90f2eda4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9303989e\" id=\"u9303989e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">I</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uee5ca0d8\" id=\"uee5ca0d8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：无符号整型（4 字节）。</span></li><li fid=\"u9a96121d\" data-lake-id=\"u93598081\" id=\"u93598081\"><code data-lake-id=\"udfdb5889\" id=\"udfdb5889\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1099b43c\" id=\"u1099b43c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">l</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u77997635\" id=\"u77997635\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：有符号长整型（4 字节）。</span></li><li fid=\"u9a96121d\" data-lake-id=\"ub9635842\" id=\"ub9635842\"><code data-lake-id=\"uc1e9d5cc\" id=\"uc1e9d5cc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u23465693\" id=\"u23465693\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">L</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue68f386d\" id=\"ue68f386d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：无符号长整型（4 字节）。</span></li><li fid=\"u9a96121d\" data-lake-id=\"ue3d8d0bc\" id=\"ue3d8d0bc\"><code data-lake-id=\"u63b10226\" id=\"u63b10226\"><span data-lake-id=\"uad2026b3\" id=\"uad2026b3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">q</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5d6159fc\" id=\"u5d6159fc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：有符号长长整型（8 字节）。</span></li><li fid=\"u9a96121d\" data-lake-id=\"u405e3384\" id=\"u405e3384\"><code data-lake-id=\"ue883ef0e\" id=\"ue883ef0e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufcc24647\" id=\"ufcc24647\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">Q</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7c3e53c0\" id=\"u7c3e53c0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：无符号长长整型（8 字节）。</span></li><li fid=\"u9a96121d\" data-lake-id=\"ue3eebca9\" id=\"ue3eebca9\"><code data-lake-id=\"ud7c22f30\" id=\"ud7c22f30\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4b829f70\" id=\"u4b829f70\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">f</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5bc25366\" id=\"u5bc25366\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：浮点型（4 字节）。</span></li><li fid=\"u9a96121d\" data-lake-id=\"u047018ac\" id=\"u047018ac\"><code data-lake-id=\"u2924883c\" id=\"u2924883c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u192cc92a\" id=\"u192cc92a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">d</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u91be07aa\" id=\"u91be07aa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：双精度浮点型（8 字节）。</span></li><li fid=\"u9a96121d\" data-lake-id=\"ub0f9f3f5\" id=\"ub0f9f3f5\"><code data-lake-id=\"u0f2f14dd\" id=\"u0f2f14dd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u55599119\" id=\"u55599119\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">s</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf6cfeac0\" id=\"uf6cfeac0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：字符串（需要指定长度，如</span><span data-lake-id=\"u6ba80a8b\" id=\"u6ba80a8b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"uf5eac849\" id=\"uf5eac849\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueb976330\" id=\"ueb976330\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">10s</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0840a6ca\" id=\"u0840a6ca\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u387f281a\" id=\"u387f281a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">表示 10 字节的字符串）。</span></li><li fid=\"u9a96121d\" data-lake-id=\"ue8d181ce\" id=\"ue8d181ce\"><code data-lake-id=\"u17c07bef\" id=\"u17c07bef\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc25ccbc5\" id=\"uc25ccbc5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">p</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud5c9eb70\" id=\"ud5c9eb70\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：Pascal 字符串（1 字节长度 + 字符串）。</span></li><li fid=\"u9a96121d\" data-lake-id=\"ufeefe734\" id=\"ufeefe734\"><code data-lake-id=\"u292421b6\" id=\"u292421b6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4471ef68\" id=\"u4471ef68\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">x</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8706045e\" id=\"u8706045e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：填充字节（跳过 1 字节）。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u72819769\" id=\"u72819769\"><br></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"N9gRQ\" id=\"N9gRQ\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub5f3cdf9\" id=\"ub5f3cdf9\" style=\"color: rgb(var(--ds-rgb-label-1))\">示例 1：解析单个值</span></h4><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20struct%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E4%BA%8C%E8%BF%9B%E5%88%B6%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%884%20%E5%AD%97%E8%8A%82%E7%9A%84%E6%97%A0%E7%AC%A6%E5%8F%B7%E6%95%B4%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%89%5Cnbuffer%20%3D%20b'%5C%5Cx01%5C%5Cx00%5C%5Cx00%5C%5Cx00'%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E4%B8%BA%E6%97%A0%E7%AC%A6%E5%8F%B7%E6%95%B4%E5%9E%8B%5Cnvalue%20%3D%20struct.unpack('%3CI'%2C%20buffer)%5Cnprint(value)%20%20%23%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%3A%20(1%2C)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G7QcB%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h4 data-lake-id=\"mwuw9\" id=\"mwuw9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2753fb29\" id=\"u2753fb29\" style=\"color: rgb(var(--ds-rgb-label-1))\">示例 2：解析多个值</span></h4><c